title simplest-crud-photo98

component photo-webapp as "Photo Gallery" web-application
component photo-api as "Photo API" service
component photo-db as "Photo Metadata DB" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south aws-s3 as "AWS S3" service

north -> photo-webapp

photo-webapp -> photo-api
photo-webapp -> user-auth

photo-api -> user-auth
photo-api -> aws-s3
photo-api -> photo-db
